> Try to always have a clear path back to the upstairs, so you can run away.

And don't get surrounded. Ever.
If you see a room full of moving monsters, don't go in. Wait at the
doorway until one comes next to you, retreat to the corridor and then
fight that one monster. Or if you're low on Hp, run away instead of
waiting, and come back when you're healed. Repeat until the room is
cleared. 

Notice that there are special rooms (throne room, zoo, beehive etc.) full of
monsters, but they are generated sleeping. In these cases you can go in,
but be careful to only fight one of them at a time. Don't wake up the next
monster before you've finished the previous one.

